{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "3505588",
  "name": "LiT BANGKOK Hotel and Residence",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "4556160"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "Located in Bangkok (Bangkok City Centre), LiT BANGKOK Residence is a 4-minute walk from Bangkok Art \u0026 Culture Centre and 8 minutes by foot from MBK Center.  This spa aparthotel is 0.4 mi (0.7 km) from Siam Paragon Mall and 0.7 mi (1.2 km) from CentralWorld Shopping Complex."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 48 air-conditioned rooms featuring kitchenettes with refrigerators and stovetops. Rooms have private balconies. 40-inch LCD televisions with satellite programming provide entertainment, while complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected. Bathrooms with separate bathtubs and showers feature deep soaking bathtubs and complimentary toiletries."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Relax at the full-service spa, where you can enjoy massages. You can take advantage of recreational amenities such as an outdoor pool and a fitness center. Additional features at this aparthotel include complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a banquet hall."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EBangkok Art \u0026 Culture Centre - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Center - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Jim Thompson House Museum - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E MBK Center - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chulalongkorn University - 0.7 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Paragon Mall - 0.7 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Siam Square - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E CentralWorld Shopping Complex - 1.2 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Erawan Shrine - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Samyan Mitrtown - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Pratunam Market - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Platinum Fashion Mall - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Central Chidlom Department Store - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Central Embassy - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Baiyoke Tower II - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EDon Mueang Intl. Airport (DMK) - 24.4 km / 15.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK) - 31.6 km / 19.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for LiT BANGKOK Residence is Suvarnabhumi Intl. Airport (BKK). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards, debit cards, and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHost has not indicated whether there is a carbon monoxide detector on the property; consider bringing a portable detector with you on the trip\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHost has indicated there is a smoke detector on the property\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher and a security system\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property is professionally cleaned\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EReservations are required for massage services and spa treatments. Reservations can be made by contacting the aparthotel prior to arrival, using the contact information on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUp to 2 children 11 years old and younger stay free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe property has connecting/adjoining rooms, which are subject to availability and can be requested by contacting the property using the number on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENo pets and no service animals are allowed at this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA car is not required for transportation to and from this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe property is professionally cleaned.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Take advantage of the aparthotel\u0027s room service (during limited hours). Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at the poolside bar. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 6:30 AM to 10:30 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
